                        <cell>Santiago, September 7, 1877.</cell>
                        <cell>Decline of trade between the United States and Chili; prospects of
                            improvements; will collect and forward statistics.</cell>
                        <cell><ref target="#pg31">31</ref></cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
